        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kaako zintu zyoonse zili buti nzimuyanda kuti bantu bamucitile, anywebo amubacitile nzizyonya, nkaambo mbuboobo mbuuamba Mulao abasinsimi.",
          "type": "text",
