        },
        {
          "text": "Amunjile mumulyango uumanikide, nkaambo mulyango uukwazeme anzila impati njiitola kukunyonyooka, nkabela abo banjila mulinjiyo mbanjibanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.7.13",
